```

## Rules
- One <section> per card, in order
- Copy imageLayout and group attributes from the plan into each <section>
- Copy cardInstructions into <instructions> element verbatim
- Write content that follows the writing style guide and density constraints
- The first section should be a title card with <h1> for the deck title
- For content cards: use <h1> for card titles
- Do NOT add attributes beyond imageLayout, group, and role

## Wrapping Format
Wrap all sections in an <outline> root with a <deckIntent> element:

<outline>
  <deckIntent>The deck intent from the plan</deckIntent>
  <section imageLayout="blank">...</section>
  ...
</outline>

