## Context
Deck intent: A data-dense analytical deck positioning climate tech as a $2.8T investment opportunity with specific sector breakdowns, regulatory catalysts, and risk-adjusted return projections. Dark corporate aesthetic with heavy statistical displays, comparative frameworks, and multi-zone content stacking. Every card proves a specific investment thesis with hard numbers and structured analysis.
